  "description": "Full-sized and full speed ahead. The Pro XL is the biggest of the Race Lite series with a 21\" top tube to fit the taller set. The 6000 series aluminum frame is low-profile with stable geometry to keep it tracking straight at the highest speeds. Chromoly forks and 8\" rise bars make for a solid front end, able to handle even the harshest landings. Sealed bearings all around, a Promax disc brake and fast/grippy Kenda Konversion tires put the power to the track.\n6061-T6 Heat Treated Alloy Frame w/ Integrated Headtube, Internal Cable Routing, Smooth Welding & Haro 3D Dropouts w/ Integrated Chain Tensioners. 21\" top tube.\nFull chromoly 1 1/8\" Threadless Steerer w/tapered legs\n2-pc Forged 170mm alloy w/ 24mm hollow spindle. Sealed BB. 44T chainring.\n20\" Alloy 36h, double-wall rims\n36h Alloy sealed bearing hubs w/disc 16T cassette rear\nKenda \"Konversion\" 20 x 1.95\" Front / 20 x 1.75\" Rear",
